WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.530
A contract can look perfect,

2
00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:02.950
and still be broken inside.

3
00:00:03.807 --> 00:00:04.583
Some are void.

4
00:00:04.627 --> 00:00:05.857
They never existed at all.

5
00:00:06.627 --> 00:00:07.403
Others are voidable.

6
00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:09.417
They stand, until someone sets them

7
00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:09.677
aside.

8
00:00:10.451 --> 00:00:11.641
But you can only set it

9
00:00:11.491 --> 00:00:13.301
aside if both sides can go

10
00:00:13.151 --> 00:00:13.981
back to the start.

11
00:00:14.631 --> 00:00:15.821
You can't put the rock back.

12
00:00:16.562 --> 00:00:17.672
Illegal from the start?

13
00:00:18.282 --> 00:00:19.632
Void. A big mistake you both

14
00:00:19.482 --> 00:00:21.652
made? Void. Your own mistake?

15
00:00:21.862 --> 00:00:23.092
You're usually stuck with it.

16
00:00:23.633 --> 00:00:24.783
A lie that gets you to

17
00:00:24.633 --> 00:00:26.543
sign is a misrepresentation.

18
00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:29.043
Innocent, negligent, or fraudulent.

19
00:00:29.773 --> 00:00:31.883
Only negligent or fraudulent gets you

20
00:00:31.733 --> 00:00:32.123
damages.

21
00:00:33.008 --> 00:00:34.738
Small print can't take your rights.

22
00:00:35.388 --> 00:00:37.398
A trader can't exclude injury caused

23
00:00:37.248 --> 00:00:39.558
by negligence. And a ban on

24
00:00:39.408 --> 00:00:41.338
working for rivals must be reasonable,

25
00:00:41.188 --> 00:00:42.338
or it's void.

26
00:00:43.044 --> 00:00:43.974
So always ask:

27
00:00:44.164 --> 00:00:44.754
does it hold?
